  "bodyHash": "b060ecbe03c6a661",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/banner.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/banner.png\" alt=\"Automobility\"></a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#a-minecraft-mod-adding-customizable-vehicles\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>一款可自訂車輛的 Minecraft 模組。</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Automobility 目前處於 BETA 測試階段！</strong><br>此模組尚未完成所有功能，非常歡迎提出功能建議。請至模組的 GitHub Discussions 頁面討論，或在<span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7Aw3y4RtY9\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#available-for-fabricquilt\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>支援 <strong>Fabric/Quilt</strong> 與 <strong>Forge</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>需要&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></strong></span>&nbsp;(Fabric) 或<span style=\"color:#f60\">&nbsp;<strong><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fqsl\" rel=\"nofollow\">QSL</a></strong></span>&nbsp;(Quilt)</li>\n<li>在 Forge 上無需額外安裝其他模組</li>\n<li>請點擊頁面頂部的<strong>Files</strong>以查看所有模組載入器的版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">目前維護版本為 1.20/1.20.1，</span>&nbsp;舊版本已停止支援</strong></span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>開始遊玩</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配方：</strong>可使用<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EMI</strong></a></span>&nbsp;(Fabric/Quilt) 或<span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>&nbsp;</span>(Forge) 查看合成配方。</li>\n<li><strong>汽車零件：</strong>製作汽車維修台。使用介面合成汽車的車架、引擎和輪胎。您也可以選擇性製作配件。</li>\n<li><strong>組裝汽車：</strong>製作汽車組裝機以及撬棍。將零件放置於組裝機上，直到車輛組裝完成。使用撬棍可拆除該車輛。</li>\n<li><strong>升級汽車：</strong>使用汽車維修台製作配件，安裝到汽車上以增添實用功能或特殊效果。</li>\n<li><strong>道路建設：</strong>您可以使用斜坡、加速板、越野地磚等方塊來建造道路、賽道或障礙賽道。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/construction.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/construction.png\" alt=\"汽車組裝\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/parking.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/parking.png\" alt=\"汽車類型\"></a></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility#driving\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><strong>駕駛操作</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>W - 加速</li>\n<li>S - 煞車/倒車/燒胎</li>\n<li>A/D - 左轉/右轉</li>\n<li>空白鍵 - 漂移</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>手把支援：</strong>搭配<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightcontrols\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightControls</a></span>時，您可以使用以下預設控制項來操控汽車：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A - 加速</li>\n<li>B - 煞車/倒車</li>\n<li>左搖桿 - 左轉/右轉</li>\n<li>右扳機 - 漂移</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/blob/1.18.2/md/driving.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/FoundationGames/Automobility/raw/1.18.2/md/driving.png\" alt=\"駕駛畫面\"></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
